   environment issues. The traffic noise has different characters in each
   of main road due to different size and weight of vehicles that go
   through the road in which resulted different noise intensity. In this
   study, the noise traffic measurement was conducted to get the data. The
   purpose of this study is to present the traffic noise model which
   compared to the actual traffic noise level that resulted from vehicle
   flow on the roads. The two models of predictive noise traffic have the
