   Pb were 0.02-0.30, 0.02-0.20, 0.02-0.60, 14-500, 1.30-351, 0.10-2.40,
   0.14-8.60, 0.30-50, 1.90-180, 0.06-0.60, 0.02-0.86, 0.02-8.0, 0.02-8.0
   and 0.38-102 mg/kg, respectively. The extractable proportions of heavy
   metals were relatively low compared to their total concentrations, with
