   Educ; Federat Finnish Learned Soc; Abo Akademi Fdn},
Abstract = {Health technology is the fastest growing high technology field in
   Finland. However, developing new products, getting international or
   finding new markets can be challenging in the highly regulated and
   rapidly changing healthcare environment. This paper presents issues in
   healthcare as a business environment. A financial analysis was conducted
   to get an overview about the current stage of Finnish health technology
   industry. A survey was also conducted in order to find out the
   challenges Finnish health technology companies are facing. The
   preliminary results of this financial analysis and survey are reported
   and then discussed.},
