Abstract = {At present, the elderly people in China are bearing pressures at
   different levels from living conditions, public transport, social
   participation, social belonging, and some other aspects. Recently, a
   relevant elderly-care survey was done. Along with actual situation and
   statistics, it indicates affecting factors basically in two phases:
   personal factors and social factors. Then urban public facilities
   requirements which differ from the general can be deduced. In order to
   fulfill related requirements, six design points of urban public
   facilities are listed in consistent with synthesizing the four pivotal
   parts - human, product, environment, and the society, which contain
   public facilities-network establishment, guidance improvement, material
   selection and so forth.},
