   and Subtropical Greenhouses, TAICHUNG, TAIWAN, APR 15-18, 2001},
Organization = {Natl Sci Council; Minist Educ; Council Agr Taiwan; Taiwan Agr Res Inst;
   Rural Dev Fdn; Natl Taiwan Univ, Dept Hort; Natl Chung Hsing Univ, Dept
   Hort; Natl Chung Hsing Univ, Dept Agr Machinery Engn; Natl Inst Technol,
