Abstract = {The principles and methods of geostatistics are introduced. With the
   help of variogram, the contents of the water quality. NH4+-N, TP and
   COD, in rivers in the city of south China are analyzed. By using the
   Kriging, the special distributions of the content of NH4+-N, TP and COD
