   Responsibility - Tourism, Society and Education Session, Berlin,
   GERMANY, AUG 29-30, 2014},
Organization = {Tianjin Univ Finance \& Econ, Tourism Dept; IMRE Alumni Network; German
   Acad Exchange Serv Fdn; TU Bergakademie Freiberg},
Abstract = {In this paper, the DEA model is applied in the study of financial
   support efficiency for listed companies in five urban economic circles
   in China, such as Dianzhong, Nanning, Chengyu, Wuhan and Zhengzhou. The
   financial overall efficiency, the financial pure technical efficiency
   and the financial scale efficiency of each economic circle have been
   calculated. In addition, a comparative analysis has been made about the
   financial support efficiency. Empirical results show that the Chengyu
   circle has the lowest overall efficiency during the period because of
   its lower pure technical efficiency and scale efficiency. The
   improvement of scale efficiency in Dianzhong circle raised its overall
   financial support efficiency. In order to improve the overall financial
   efficiency, Zhengzhou circle should raise its financial scale. Nanning,
   Wuhan and especially Chengyu circle should increase financial support
   scale and the strength of economic structure adjustment. This research
   may provide reference for the sustainable development in facilitating
   sustainable economic development in China.},
