   Res; SPIE Russia Chapter; Opt Soc Amer; USAF, Off Sci Res, USAF Res Lab,
   European Off Aerosp Res \& Dev},
Abstract = {Coniferous trees are characterized by a high sensibility to an
   atmospheric pollution.(1,2) Therefore, they are widely used in
   contamination level indication. Methods, basing on the chlorophyll
   fluorescence recording, are among the fastest methods of plants
   physiological state definition. In present work the physiological state
   of coniferous trees, growing in several districts of Tomsk City with
   different degree of air pollution was investigated by fluorescent
   methods. It was found that in winter-spring time the fluorescence
   intensity of the trees in stronger polluted areas is higher. The reason
   is that the weakened plants can not reach the state of the deep
   dormancy. Therefore, under artificial removing, they overpass this state
   earlier, showing the higher physiological activity in comparison with
   plants of the pure sites.},
