Abstract = {In this paper, we review application of virtual environment systems to
   emergency management. Section I describes new possibilities that virtual
   environment technology offers. In Section 2, we analyze application of
   virtual environment technology to simulation and first responders
   training during the preparedness phase of an emergency. Section 3
   discusses mobile augmented reality systems for first responders'
   equipment, navigation and three-dimensional (313) geographic information
   representation, damage evaluation and reconstruction of buildings.
