Organization = {Sustainable Dev City Grp; Cent S Univ, Hunan Inst Syst Engn \&
   Management},
Abstract = {Clean production is a new and creative paradigm that employs the
   environmental strategy of continuous overall prevention on the
   production process, products, and services. On the background of
   sustainable development, there is an urgent need for a method to
   quantitatively analyze the sustainability of a corporation's clean
   production. Emergy analysis theory explores a new perspective in the
   complex system of nature, the economy and society from all dimensions
   and develops a new method for quantitatively studying ecological
   systems, ecological economic systems and human activities. This method
   also provides a valid criterion for appraising sustainable development.
   In this paper, a longitudinal comparative study on the sustainability of
   the clean production of enterprise was conducted based on the emergy
   theory, using the example of Xinjiang Tianye Industrial Park, with the
   aim of identifying the development direction of the chloro-alkali
   industrial system from a sustainable perspective, and providing a
   scientific basis for stipulating appropriate management and control
   measures and development strategies. The results show that the clean
   production is the effective way of sustainable development of
   enterprise.},
